#. Description of the plugin
#: google-site-kit.php
msgid "Site Kit is a one-stop solution for WordPress users to use everything Google has to offer to make them successful on the web."
msgstr "Site Kit é una solución integral para que os usuarios de WordPress utilicen todo o que Google ten que ofrecer para que teñan éxito na web."